    <version>0.5.16</version>
    <time>1791458861</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.5.16 (carries 0.5.15). LOCKSTEP part 1/2: opencode 2.0.24 pins @opentui/* = 0.5.16 via its private unversioned FFI ABI, so its matching update follows as part 2/2; neither half works without the other.</comment>
